{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:17 2026-10-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:57 2026-10-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:57 2026-10-06 HKT</p><p>旺角住宅大廈天台發生火警。今日（10月6日）下午5時半左右，奶路臣街2至2K號順景大廈的天台發生火警，現場火光熊熊，衝天濃煙滾滾，多人報案求助，近90名居民疏散至樓下暫避。</p><img alt=\"起火天台烈焰衝天。讀者劉先生提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc8e4db77ef523bef264f062ac2ca6b4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_19_21_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火天台烈焰衝天。讀者劉先生提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce458142422269c62f97888d1c09893e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_19_21_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be033e56369af51edf40077016ef0e19/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_08_06_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火警疑涉燒著天台雜物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b08a314006d3c67f1a3191555ebe6699/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_08_05_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火警疑涉燒著天台雜物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/79c7509047a41d10fc2b69cb4955d77b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_19_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為旺角奶路臣街近廣東道一樓宇。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc26d3e1a6efe55167cb5eeb9ce074c7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火光熊熊，濃煙衝天。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9df3264502b1748fa4f679a2889e4cef/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙離遠清晰可見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/647b25c3c6a09d9d02777fa3e5445632/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_17_54_05.jpeg\"/><h2>消防出動無人機監測火勢</h2><p>消防接報趕至，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，同時出動無人機離遠監測火勢。火警焚燒逾1小時，至傍晚6時半左右被救熄，幸目前暫未有受傷報告。</p><p>據了解， 頂層住戶已暫時安頓於社區中心，初步調查相信祭祀蠟燭疑燒到附近雜物肇禍。</p><img alt=\"大批消防到場救火。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5e0861641548d74bf144813b6db1a5e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_21_08_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動無人機監測火勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a001e0f5991e4ef4006acb4d2fa5e2fd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_53_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員拖喉上樓救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1a2ea365120d74a7f07542b6e6a86b8c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_50_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員拖喉上樓救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/36db3b5b968d14a4189f7b27860634ad/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_50_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員拖喉上樓救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3ff48cf833fe9fcf537a5d05a54f79d8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_50_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名居民疏散至樓下暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/804f6860d479c6a2b3148cf6180bf09b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_26_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名居民疏散至樓下暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b656644926252ee0a467ff7022355660/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_26_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名居民疏散至樓下暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b252e4329b94eb0da9f91718ac80585/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-06_at_18_59_44.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T14:39:54.390443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}